OL,3,GNEWSA'I'm terrified trail hunting ban
OL,4,Awill go through'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It's terrifying. It's all I know,"
OL,7,Fsays Will Gaskell.
OL,9,FSince starting as an apprentice, he has
OL,10,Fviewed trail hunting as a career for
OL,11,Flife.
OL,13,FBut the likelihood of a ban by the
OL,14,Fgovernment looks set to shatter the
OL,15,F20-year-old's future with the
OL,16,FWorcestershire Hunt.
OL,18,FWidely adopted as a legal alternative
OL,19,Fto fox hunting - following the 2004
OL,20,FHunting Act - trail hunting involves
OL,21,Fhounds following an artificially laid
OL,22,Fscent.
